---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Fable Connectors" description="Connector matrix with honest status labels.">
  <div style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
    <h1>Connectors Matrix</h1>
    <p>Every integration in Fable operates under a strict verification boundary. The statuses are defined as:</p>
    
    <ul>
      <li><strong style="color: var(--positive);">Implemented</strong>: Fully functional local runtime code.</li>
      <li><strong style="color: var(--caution);">Functional but gated</strong>: Active code, but requires external user API credentials or server deployment.</li>
      <li><strong style="color: var(--info);">Preview-only</strong>: Fixture/preview state only; live implementation deferred.</li>
      <li><strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Missing</strong>: Planned integration; no functional adapter exists.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="card" style="margin-top: 2rem; padding: 0;">
      <table style="margin: 0; width: 100%;">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Integration</th>
            <th>Label</th>
            <th>Notes</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Local files</td>
            <td><span class="status implemented">Implemented</span></td>
            <td>Live in Tauri runtime</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Knowledge search &amp; memory</td>
            <td><span class="status implemented">Implemented</span></td>
            <td>Encrypted local SQLite vault</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>BYOK API providers</td>
            <td><span class="status implemented">Implemented</span></td>
            <td>User supplies keys locally</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Google Drive, Gmail, Calendar</td>
            <td><span class="status gated">Functional but gated</span></td>
            <td>Requires user Google Cloud OAuth credentials</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>GitHub, Vercel, Notion, Slack, Linear</td>
            <td><span class="status gated">Functional but gated</span></td>
            <td>Requires local broker deployment</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>GitHub writes</td>
            <td><span class="status missing">Missing</span></td>
            <td>Implemented live surface is read-only</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Local models</td>
            <td><span class="status missing">Missing</span></td>
            <td>UI labels show planned/disabled</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Browser automation</td>
            <td><span class="status preview">Preview-only</span></td>
            <td>Synthetic fixture preview only</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Voice dictation</td>
            <td><span class="status preview">Preview-only</span></td>
            <td>Relies on browser Web Speech API</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="fine" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">Grounded in <code>docs/product/status.md</code> and <code>docs/product/connectors.md</code>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
